<div class='tw-pb-[60px]'>
  <h5 class='tw-text-primary-text tw-text-[2rem]'>
    Do you know today is
    <strong>
      <script src='https://www.hebcal.com/etc/hdate-en.js'></script></strong
    >? We do, and that’s why we’re here.
  </h5>
  <h2 class='tw-text-[44px] md:tw-text-[56px] tw-py-3 tw-font-semibold tw-text-primary'>Create a Yahrzeit Reminder:</h2>
  <h5 class='tw-text-primary-text tw-text-[2rem] tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-gap-[16px]'>
    <div>
      On anniversary of a loved one's passing we honor their memory by lighting a Yahrzeit candle, reciting the Kaddish
      prayer, giving extra charity, and learning Torah.
    </div>
    <div>
      Continue tradition in your Jewish home with our help. Use our FREE tool to determine the Hebrew date of your loved
      one's yahrzeit and then the reminders you wish.
    </div>
    <div>
      In Judaism, the day begins at nightfall. Before we can provide the exact Yahrtzeit we must determine if the
      passing was before or after sundown.
    </div>
  </h5>
</div>

